<p><br />
Yab Naz ZEHRA (SA) Ya Moosa Ibne Jafar (AS).....2<br />
Babul Hawaij Ya MUSA IBNE JAFAR (AS)<br />
Saiyadi MAULA (AS).....4</p>

<p>Kaisa Kaidi Hai Ke Marne Pe Bhi Azad Nahi<br />
Kaisi Gurbat Hai, Janaze Pe Bhi Faryad Nahi<br />
Mere MAULA Pe Hui Kaunsi rudaad Nahi<br />
Hai Nazdeek Koi Rone Ko Aulad Nahi<br />
Bekas O Tanha,Ya MUSA IBNE JAFAR (AS)</p>

<p>Yab Naz ZEHRA (SA) MUSA IBNE JAFAR (AS).....2<br />
Saiyadi MAULA (AS).....3</p>

<p>Malkae Kum Ka Padar,bani E Mashad Ka Padar<br />
Seerat E MUSTUFA (SAWW) Bhi, Waris E Hauz E Kausar<br />
Hai Mazloomi Janaza Hai Sare Rahe Guzar<br />
Jub Ke Maujood Hai Rone Ko Pisar Aur Dukhtar<br />
Pul Pe Tha Lasha, Ya MUSA IBNE JAFAR (AS)</p>

<p>Yab Naz ZEHRA (SA) Ya Moosa Ibne Jafar (AS).....2<br />
Saiyadi MAULA (AS).....3</p>

<p>Kaid Me Chaudah Baras Kaise Guzare Honge<br />
Surat E Ashk Musalle Pe Sitare Honge<br />
Tauk O Zanjeer Bhala Kisne Utare Honge<br />
Gamzada Arsh Pe Quran Ke Pare Honge<br />
Kaise Du Pursa, Ya MUSA IBNE JAFAR (AS)</p>

<p>Yab Naz ZEHRA (SA) Ya Moosa Ibne Jafar (AS).....2<br />
Saiyadi MAULA (AS).....3</p>

<p>Qaid E Tanhi Thi Aur MUSA E KAZIM MAULA (AS)<br />
Khatm Beenai Thi Aur MUSA E KAZIM MAULA (AS)<br />
Sitam Aaraie Thi Aur MUSA E KAZIM MAULA (AS)<br />
Maut Ghabraie Thi Aur MUSA E KAZIM MAULA (AS)<br />
Waqt Ka Aqa, Ya MUSA IBNE JAFAR (AS)</p>

<p>Yab Naz ZEHRA (SA) Ya Moosa Ibne Jafar (AS).....2<br />
Saiyadi MAULA (AS).....3</p>

<p>Kasrate Sajda Se Gathri Sa Badanaap Ka Tha<br />
Log Keh Te The Musalle Pe Hai Kapda Sa Pada<br />
Par Qaza Ho Na Saka Waqt E Shahadat Sajda<br />
Dam Ba Dam Aati Rahi Arsh Se Aawaz E Khuda (swt)<br />
Der Na Karna, Ya Moosa Ibne Jafar (AS)</p>

<p>Yab Naz ZEHRA (SA) Ya MUSA IBNE JAFAR (AS).....2<br />
Saiyadi MAULA (AS).....3</p>

<p>Haqim E Wat Ne Kaisa Yeh Sitam Dhaya Hai,<br />
Qabr Mein MADAR E HASNAIN (AS) To Tadpaya Hai<br />
Zaher Khurmo Mein Mere MAULA Ko Pilwaya Hai<br />
Jasad E Paak Ko Mazdooron Se Uthwaya Hai<br />
Roti Thi ZEHRA (SA), Ya MUSA IBNE JAFAR (AS)</p>

<p>Yab Naz ZEHRA (SA) Ya MUSA IBNE JAFAR (AS).....2<br />
Saiyadi MAULA (AS).....3</p>

<p>Koi Aais Ana Tha Maiyat Ko Kafan Pehnaie<br />
Mashad O Qum Koi Jaake Khabar Pohuchai<br />
Rone Wale Na The Mazdoor Janaza Laaie<br />
Girya Karne Ko Janaze Pe Parinde Aaie<br />
Aasma Roya,Ya MUSA IBNE JAFAR (AS)</p>

<p>Yab Naz ZEHRA (SA) Ya MUSA IBNE JAFAR (AS).....2<br />
Saiyadi MAULA (AS).....3</p>

<p>Ibne Jafar Na Aseeri Pe Sitam Par Roie<br />
Tauk Par Roie Na Zanjeer E Kadam Par Roie<br />
Haan Magar Roie To Bus Shahe Umam Par Roie<br />
Apne Jad Aabid E Beemar Ke Gam Par Roie<br />
Padh Te The Nauha, Ya MUSA IBNE JAFAR (AS)</p>

<p>Yab Naz ZEHRA (SA) Ya MUSA IBNE JAFAR (AS).....2<br />
Saiyadi MAULA (AS).....3</p>

<p>Rote Rehte The Shahe Karbobla Ke Gam Mein<br />
Bandagi Se Hue Farig To Rahe Matam Mein<br />
AKBAR (AS), O QASIM (AS) O ABBAS (AS) The Chashme Nam Mein<br />
Saans Ki Doriyan Tooti Hai Ishi Aalam Mein<br />
Waa Mere MAULA (AS),ya Moosa Ibne Jafar (AS)</p>

<p>Yab Naz ZEHRA (SA) Ya MUSA IBNE JAFAR (AS).....2<br />
Saiyadi MAULA (AS).....3</p>

<p>As Salam Aai Mere Mazloom Garibul Gurba<br />
As Salam Aai Rasan O Tauk Me Paband E Jafa<br />
As Salam Aai Sharaf E Bab E Hawaij MAULA (AS)<br />
Alvida Sarwar O Rehan Ke MAULA Aaqa (AS)<br />
Dete Hai Pursa, Ya MUSA IBNE JAFAR (AS)</p>

